   "worked_solution": [
      {
         "step": 1,
         "text": "The outermost operation is a product of \\( e^{x} \\) and \\( \\sqrt{1 + \\sin(4x)} \\), so the product rule comes first: \\( f'(x) = \\left(e^{x}\\right)'\\,\\sqrt{1 + \\sin(4x)} + e^{x}\\left(\\sqrt{1 + \\sin(4x)}\\right)' \\).",
         "mathjson": [
