                  1
               ]
            ]
         ]
      },
      {
         "step": 4,
         "text": "Assemble the product rule: \\( f'(x) = \\sqrt{\\sin{\\left(4 x \\right)} + 1} e^{x} + \\frac{2 e^{x} \\cos{\\left(4 x \\right)}}{\\sqrt{\\sin{\\left(4 x \\right)} + 1}} \\).",
